OL,3,A'It took me two years to get a job':
OL,4,AData shows one in eight young people
OL,5,Anot in work or education
OL,6,
OL,7,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,8,FMcFadden says the government is
OL,9,Fdetermined to "turn the tide" on youth
OL,10,Funemployment
OL,12,FThe Conservatives say Labour has
OL,13,F"destroyed job opportunities for young
OL,14,Fpeople" through taxes that affect
OL,15,Femployers' ability to hire
